codex
The new equality closes the exact two-batch orphan-record attack, but it is only a set-coverage check. I’m now testing whether a forged disposition can “reference” the displaced literature record without preserving why or when that record was created, especially through `MANUAL_QUEUE` and the indistinguishable `NEW_IMPORT`/`EXISTING_OBSERVED` histories.
